1
00:00:01,199 --> 00:00:04,213
Learn Colors with Mimo Bunny!

2
00:00:06,977 --> 00:00:11,957
Mimo: Hi friends! It's me, Mimo! Guess what day it is today?

3
00:00:13,557 --> 00:00:16,950
Mimo: It's painting day! Look at all my paint!

4
00:00:17,250 --> 00:00:20,728
Mimo: So many colors! Let's learn them together!

5
00:00:22,462 --> 00:00:25,785
Bruno: Hi Mimo! Painting? Can I help? I'm a super painter!

6
00:00:26,085 --> 00:00:31,074
Mimo: Okay, Bruno! But be careful. Paint can be very messy.

7
00:00:31,374 --> 00:00:33,675
Bruno: Don't worry! Careful is my middle name!

8
00:00:35,797 --> 00:00:38,476
Mimo: First, let's paint a yummy apple.

9
00:00:40,376 --> 00:00:42,778
Mimo: Red! The apple is red!

10
00:00:43,078 --> 00:00:44,558
Mimo: Can you say red?

11
00:00:47,958 --> 00:00:49,838
Mimo: Great job! Red!

12
00:00:50,138 --> 00:00:52,370
Bruno: Red is my favorite! Let me see!

13
00:00:56,591 --> 00:00:58,359
Bruno: Uh oh! Now I'm a red bear!

14
00:01:00,659 --> 00:01:03,906
Mimo: Silly Bruno! You're as red as an apple!

15
00:01:04,206 --> 00:01:07,661
Mimo: Next color! Let's paint a crunchy carrot.

16
00:01:09,561 --> 00:01:12,178
Mimo: Orange! The carrot is orange!

17
00:01:12,478 --> 00:01:14,058
Mimo: Can you say orange?

18
00:01:17,458 --> 00:01:19,516
Mimo: Orange! Great job!

19
00:01:21,816 --> 00:01:24,912
Mimo: Hmm. That carrot looks so crunchy...

20
00:01:27,721 --> 00:01:30,300
Mimo: Hey! It tastes like paint!

21
00:01:34,100 --> 00:01:35,635
Bruno: Mimo! It's just a picture!

22
00:01:37,691 --> 00:01:41,211
Pip: Hi everybody! Are you painting? Can I paint too?

23
00:01:41,511 --> 00:01:45,837
Mimo: Hi Pip! Yes! Let's paint the big, bright sun!

24
00:01:48,630 --> 00:01:51,326
Pip: Yellow! The sun is yellow! Just like me!

25
00:01:51,626 --> 00:01:53,016
Mimo: Can you say yellow?

26
00:01:57,116 --> 00:01:58,486
Pip: Yellow, yellow, yellow!

27
00:01:58,786 --> 00:02:01,935
Mimo: Pip, you're the most yellow friend I have!

28
00:02:03,670 --> 00:02:06,947
Lulu: Hello friends! What a colorful garden!

29
00:02:07,247 --> 00:02:10,580
Mimo: Lulu! Let's paint a leaf from the tree!

30
00:02:13,176 --> 00:02:17,155
Lulu: Green! The leaf is green! And the grass is green too!

31
00:02:17,455 --> 00:02:18,906
Mimo: Can you say green?

32
00:02:22,306 --> 00:02:23,913
Mimo: Green! Hooray!

33
00:02:26,813 --> 00:02:29,847
Lulu: Bruno! You sneezed paint on me!

34
00:02:30,147 --> 00:02:31,852
Lulu: Now I'm a green kitty!

35
00:02:32,152 --> 00:02:33,892
Bruno: Oops! Sorry, Lulu!

36
00:02:36,192 --> 00:02:39,677
Mimo: Now let's paint a fish that swims in the sea.

37
00:02:41,577 --> 00:02:45,619
Mimo: Blue! The fish is blue! And the sea is blue too!

38
00:02:45,919 --> 00:02:47,278
Mimo: Can you say blue?

39
00:02:50,678 --> 00:02:53,696
Mimo: Blue! And look... my hoodie is blue too!

40
00:02:55,496 --> 00:02:57,170
Bruno: I want to be blue too!

41
00:02:58,270 --> 00:03:00,850
Bruno: Look! Now I'm a blue bear! Like a blue whale!

42
00:03:03,150 --> 00:03:07,002
Lulu: Ooh, now it's my turn! My favorite color!

43
00:03:08,902 --> 00:03:11,190
Lulu: Purple! The grapes are purple!

44
00:03:11,490 --> 00:03:12,849
Mimo: Can you say purple?

45
00:03:16,249 --> 00:03:18,990
Mimo: Purple! Just like Lulu's fur!

46
00:03:22,625 --> 00:03:25,414
Bruno: Yuck! Painted grapes don't taste like grapes!

47
00:03:27,714 --> 00:03:29,685
Pip: Bruno! You can't eat a painting!

48
00:03:30,420 --> 00:03:35,263
Mimo: One more color! Let's paint a big heart. For all my friends!

49
00:03:37,163 --> 00:03:39,226
Mimo: Pink! The heart is pink!

50
00:03:39,526 --> 00:03:40,986
Mimo: Can you say pink?

51
00:03:46,086 --> 00:03:49,096
Mimo: A pink heart, because I love you all!

52
00:03:49,396 --> 00:03:52,158
Mimo: Now let's use ALL the colors together!

53
00:03:55,758 --> 00:04:00,081
Mimo: A rainbow! Let's say all the colors together! Ready?

54
00:04:00,381 --> 00:04:01,248
Mimo: Red!

55
00:04:02,148 --> 00:04:03,154
Mimo: Orange!

56
00:04:04,054 --> 00:04:04,721
Pip: Yellow!

57
00:04:05,621 --> 00:04:06,309
Lulu: Green!

58
00:04:07,209 --> 00:04:07,653
Bruno: Blue!

59
00:04:08,553 --> 00:04:09,607
Lulu: Purple!

60
00:04:10,507 --> 00:04:11,659
Mimo: And pink!

61
00:04:11,959 --> 00:04:15,670
Mimo: Great job, friends! You know all your colors!

62
00:04:17,270 --> 00:04:19,130
Bruno: Um, Mimo? What color am I now?

63
00:04:21,430 --> 00:04:27,336
Mimo: Hmm. Red, and blue, and a little bit of everything! You're a rainbow bear!

64
00:04:29,636 --> 00:04:32,354
Bruno: A rainbow bear! The best color of all!

65
00:04:32,654 --> 00:04:34,968
Lulu: I think the rainbow bear needs a bath!

66
00:04:35,268 --> 00:04:36,452
Bruno: Ahh. Squeaky clean!

67
00:04:36,752 --> 00:04:41,974
Mimo: Bye bye, friends! Next time, let's learn to count with Mimo!
